      "description": {
        "fun": "A gluttonous, rather dim seabird that tries to swallow everything whole, ideally an Arrokuda. Sometimes it grabs a Pikachu by mistake and just carries on with it stuck in its throat. It can forget what it's battling mid-fight, but never forgets a Trainer it trusts. Its orange shiny colouring may come from British news stories about gulls dyed orange by falling into curry sauce.",
        "guide": "A Flying and Water-type seabird Pokémon based on the cormorant. Cramorant tries to swallow prey whole, and changes into Gulping Form with an Arrokuda in its mouth or Gorging Form with a Pikachu stuck in its throat. It is strong but forgetful.",
